WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.603
Watch and read: For your sentencebuild practice, choose the correct sentence about

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:05.704
Ama and rice.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.633
The answer is: Ama likes rice.. A sentence puts the subject and action in a clear

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:11.952
order.

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:16.951
Watch and read: For your aboutme practice, you are telling a friend about yourself

00:00:16.951 --> 00:00:19.333
and your name. What is the best answer?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.213
The answer is: My name is Ama.. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful

00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:26.216
or correct response.
